1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:28,000
And now the old scout master.

2
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:38,160
So the scouts are at the grocery store buying a food to go camping and the patrol leader

3
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:43,280
looks at his shopping list and he says: well, we need a carton of milk, and if they have any

4
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,680
oranges, get six of them.

5
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:49,600
And so a couple of scouts go off and they come back holding six cartons of milk and

6
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:52,720
the patrol leader says: what, what do you do with six cartons of milk?

7
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,440
He says, well, they have oranges.

8
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:59,400
Think about it for a little while.

9
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:01,640
OK, it'll come to you.

10
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:03,640
This is podcast number 158..

