And now that has been put off until May and we are going to be discussing it here.

42
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:12,640
It is not going to be the exclusive subject of discussion, of course, because it's not

43
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:15,720
exclusively what scouting is about,

44
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:22,080
But I think it's responsible for us to do our best to have a civil discussion about this.

45
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:25,000
Obviously, we're not all going to agree,

46
